%% description: Follow one datagram from paper encoding and attachment to carriage and receipt; this scenario does not guarantee delivery.
sequenceDiagram
    participant sender as Sending Host
    participant carrier as Avian Carrier
    participant receiver as Receiving Host
    sender->>sender: Print hexadecimal scroll
    sender->>carrier: Wrap leg and tape
    Note over carrier: Variable MTU, typically 256 milligrams
    carrier->>receiver: Carry datagram
    Note over carrier: Intrinsic collision avoidance
    Note over carrier: Best effort tolerates carrier loss
    receiver->>receiver: Remove duct tape
    receiver->>receiver: Optically scan datagram

